---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section style="
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  ">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
      <h1 style="
        font-size: 3.5rem; 
        font-weight: 700; 
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a, #2563eb);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      ">
        Hassan Hussein
      </h1>
      <p style="
        font-size: 1.8rem; 
        color: #1e3a8a; 
        font-weight: 500;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      ">
        Energy Engineer | Strategy & Innovation
      </p>
      <p style="
        font-size: 1.1rem; 
        line-height: 1.7; 
        max-width: 700px; 
        color: #4a4a4a;
      ">
        Combining a Master's in Power Engineering (TUM) with hands-on R&D experience at E.ON, 
        I specialise in renewable energy integration, grid technologies, and Engineering Management. 
        Passionate about driving the energy transition through innovation and operational excellence.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact Badges -->
    <div style="
      display: flex; 
      flex-wrap: wrap; 
      gap: 1rem; 
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    ">
      <span style="background: #e5e7eb; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
        📧 hassan.hussein2424@gmail.com
      </span>
      <span style="background: #e5e7eb; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
        📍 Munich, Germany
      </span>
      <span style="background: #e5e7eb; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
        🌍 Open to Relocate
      </span>
      <span style="background: #e5e7eb; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
        🇪🇬 🇹🇷 English, Arabic, Turkish, German (B1)
      </span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Experience Section -->
  <section id="experience" style="
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  ">
    <h2 style="
      font-size: 2rem; 
      font-weight: 700; 
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: #1e3a8a;
    ">
      💼 Professional Experience
    </h2>

    <!-- E.ON -->
    <article style="margin-bottom: 2rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
            Working Student - R&D Management
          </h3>
          <p style="font-weight: 500; color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            E.ON Group Innovation - Future Lab
          </p>
        </div>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.25rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500;">
          09/2023 – 07/2025
        </span>
      </div>
      <ul style="list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #4a4a4a;">
        <li>Conducted deep-tech market research on grid digitalisation technologies and managed R&D projects.</li>
        <li>Developed value proposition and monetization strategy for a battery health project.</li>
        <li>Redesigned the end-to-end project pipeline, accelerating cycles by up to 3x.</li>
        <li>Prepared reports and presentations for senior management.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <!-- Sungrow -->
    <article style="margin-bottom: 2rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
            Intern - Technical Training
          </h3>
          <p style="font-weight: 500; color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            Sungrow Europe
          </p>
        </div>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.25rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500;">
          07/2026 – 01/2027
        </span>
      </div>
      <ul style="list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #4a4a4a;">
        <li>Supported service technical training for utility-scale ESS, PV, C&I, and Residential products.</li>
        <li>Maintained European Knowledge Base with HQ materials.</li>
        <li>Developed training materials and supported Competency Level Certification System.</li>
        <li>Maintained Service Competency Center (SCC) in Munich.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <!-- Volunteer - Organizational Development -->
    <article style="margin-bottom: 2rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
            Volunteer - Organizational Development & HR Team Lead
          </h3>
          <p style="font-weight: 500; color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            Deutsch-Arabischer Raum
          </p>
        </div>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.25rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500;">
          02/2026 – Present
        </span>
      </div>
      <ul style="list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #4a4a4a;">
        <li>Lead HR operations for a 1,200+ member organization.</li>
        <li>Planned and executed large-scale events (400+ attendees) and team-building activities.</li>
        <li>Improved volunteer onboarding and training processes.</li>
        <li>Using Salesforce (CRM) for data management and operational tracking.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <!-- Skills Section -->
  <section id="skills" style="
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  ">
    <h2 style="
      font-size: 2rem; 
      font-weight: 700; 
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: #1e3a8a;
    ">
      🛠️ Technical Skills & Tools
    </h2>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Programming & Data Analysis</h3>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">Python (pandas, numpy, scikit-learn)</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">SQL</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">MATLAB</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">Power BI</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">LCA (brightway)</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Energy System Modelling</h3>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">PyPSA</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">TESPy</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">PVsyst</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">Ansys Fluent (CFD)</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">SolidWorks</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Project Management & Tools</h3>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">Salesforce (CRM)</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">Notion</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">Slack</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">Microsoft Office Suite</span>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px;">Microsoft Project</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Education Section -->
  <section id="education" style="
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  ">
    <h2 style="
      font-size: 2rem; 
      font-weight: 700; 
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: #1e3a8a;
    ">
      🎓 Education
    </h2>

    <article style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
            M.Sc. Power Engineering
          </h3>
          <p style="font-weight: 500; color: #2563eb;">Technical University of Munich (TUM)</p>
        </div>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.25rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem;">
          10/2022 – 09/2025
        </span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 1.6;">
        <strong>Master's Thesis:</strong> Explored how thermal inertia in district heating networks can serve as virtual energy storage 
        to enhance system flexibility and integrate renewables. Using dynamic simulations with real German market data, 
        showed significant reduction in operating costs and CO₂ emissions.
      </p>
      <p style="color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
        <strong>Specialization:</strong> Renewable & Thermal Energy, Energy Storage & Economics, High Voltage Technology, Sustainable Mobility.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
            B.Sc. Energy Systems Engineering
          </h3>
          <p style="font-weight: 500; color: #2563eb;">Istanbul Bilgi University</p>
        </div>
        <span style="background: #dbeafe; padding: 0.25rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem;">
          10/2018 – 08/2022
        </span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 1.6;">
        <strong>Bachelor's Thesis (Best Senior Project Award):</strong> Investigated recovering waste heat from domestic shower 
        wastewater using heat exchangers, achieving high heat recovery efficiency and significant economic and emission savings.
      </p>
      <p style="color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
        <strong>Minor:</strong> Business Administration
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
