    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  ">
    <h2 style="
      font-size: 2rem; 
      font-weight: 700; 
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: #1e3a8a;
    ">
      ❓ Frequently Asked Questions
    </h2>

    <article style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
        What industries have you worked in?
      </h3>
      <p style="line-height: 1.6; color: #4a4a4a;">
        I've worked across renewable energy, grid digitalisation, R&D management, and industrial automation. 
        My experience spans energy utilities (E.ON), renewable energy OEMs (Sungrow), and academic research (TUM, DTU).
      </p>
    </article>

    <article style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
        What is your core technical expertise?
      </h3>
      <p style="line-height: 1.6; color: #4a4a4a;">
        Energy system modelling (PyPSA, TESPy), data analysis (Python, SQL), R&D project management, 
        deep-tech market research, techno-economic analysis, and process optimisation.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
        Are you available for freelance projects?
      </h3>
      <p style="line-height: 1.6; color: #4a4a4a;">
        Yes! I'm open to freelance, consulting, and research collaborations. 
        Contact me at <a href="mailto:hassan.hussein2424@gmail.com" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none;">hassan.hussein2424@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact Section -->
  <section id="contact" style="
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
  ">
    <h2 style="
      font-size: 2rem; 
      font-weight: 700; 
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: #1e3a8a;
    ">
      📬 Let's Connect
    </h2>
    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #4a4a4a; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      Have a project in mind or want to collaborate on energy transition initiatives? 
      Let's talk! I'm always open to new opportunities.
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center;">
      <a href="mailto:hassan.hussein2424@gmail.com" style="
        display: inline-block;
        background: #2563eb;
        color: white;
        padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
      ">
        📧 Email Me
      </a>
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/hassanhussein" style="
        display: inline-block;
        background: #0a66c2;
        color: white;
        padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 500;
      ">
        🔗 LinkedIn
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>